WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.449
Step 1. Open the Consents tab.

1.2
00:00:02.449 --> 00:00:07.653
In All Encounters, select View Encounter, then select the Consents tab.

1.3
00:00:07.653 --> 00:00:12.404
By default, this list shows only encounters created today.

2.1
00:00:12.404 --> 00:00:17.515
Step 2. Open the consent details. Select See Details on the card.

2.2
00:00:17.515 --> 00:00:22.577
Supporting Documents lists the files the consent already has.

3.1
00:00:22.577 --> 00:00:25.203
Step 3. Choose the file source.

3.2
00:00:25.203 --> 00:00:29.573
Select Add Files, then Upload From Device or Open Camera.

3.3
00:00:29.573 --> 00:00:32.450
You can add one file at a time.

4.1
00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:38.710
Step 4. Name the file. In the Upload File dialog, enter a name in File Name.

4.2
00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:40.950
The name is mandatory.

5.1
00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:43.940
Step 5. Upload the file. Select Upload.

5.2
00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:48.507
The file appears in Supporting Documents with the Uploaded badge,

5.3
00:00:48.507 --> 00:00:51.606
and Care cannot delete it afterwards.
